+
+## Fences
+- Work in a worktree; commit each working step after a smoke test; merge via `Server/merge.mjs` after reviewing the diff. Linked from the site (CLAUDE.md "Everything is linked").
+- Figma writes: only the scratch file `T5PuB8EhKhfyh0xtpIT1L0` or new files in lew42 drafts. **Never modify or delete anything in Sept-2026 or July-2026** (read only).
+- Do not touch `ai/sessions/`, `Servex/`, `core/Page` semantics (note what you need instead).
